        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"Welcome to the table. Blackjack it is, and I'm opening with 1,000 chips.\\n\\nThe rules: you and I each get two cards, and my hole card stays face down until you act. Hit to take a card, stand to hold, or double for one card at double the stake. Split is available on pairs. Going over 21 busts. A natural (Ace plus a ten-card) pays 3:2 unless I also have one, which is a push. I draw to 17 and stand on all 17s. A win pays 1:1, and equal totals push.\\n\\nPlace your bet on the table below to deal.\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":0,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"## Referenced for this message\\n### blackjack (resource)\\nblackjack, 21, hit, stand, double, split: the classic house game\\n\\nTwo cards each; dealer shows one, hole card face-down. Values: pips as printed, faces 10, Ace 1 or 11. A natural (Ace + ten-card on the deal) ends the round at once: reveal the hole card, settle it (3:2 unless the dealer also has 21, then a push), and offer no hit, stand or double. Otherwise the player acts first: hit, stand, double (one card, doubled stake), split pairs; over 21 busts immediately. Dealer then reveals and draws to 17, standing on all 17s. Blackjack (Ace + ten-card) pays 3:2, a win pays 1:1, equal totals push.\\n\\nLet's play blackjack.\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-croupier-card-table-round\",\"frontier-round-outcome\",\"frontier-result-card-win\"],\"rounds\":1,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":150200,\"total\":62350,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":27654},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":22903},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":3515},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":2358},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":5775}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":4790,\"outputTokens\":1272,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":19032},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"card-layout\",\"game-table-chrome\",\"game-hud\"],\"cacheBoundary\":50702}}}",
